  "article_html": "\n<div class=\"meta-line\">\n  <span>ISSUE #001</span><span>•</span><span class=\"archive-subject-tag sub-product-dives\">PRODUCT DIVES</span><span>•</span><span id=\"read-time-badge\">12 MIN READ</span>\n</div>\n\n<h1>Apple Home Hardware: HomeView Hub & The LG/Schneider Teardown</h1>\n<p class=\"subtitle\">\n  Thermal throttling, Thread mesh networking, and custom power delivery in smart home controllers.\n</p>\n\n\n<figure class=\"product-figure\">\n  <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n    <img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/Google_Home_Hub_circuit_board.jpg/1280px-Google_Home_Hub_circuit_board.jpg\" alt=\"In-Wall Smart Hub Structural PCB & Heat Spreader\" />\n  </div>\n  <figcaption>\n    <span><strong>FIG 01 — IN-WALL LOGIC & THERMAL SPAN:</strong> Hardware teardown of smart display controller architecture, detailing the multi-layer PCB, copper ground thermal plane, and stamped aluminum chassis heat shield.</span>\n    <span class=\"source-tag\">COMMONS TEARDOWN ARCHIVE</span>\n  </figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"section-home-thermal\">1. Thermal Constraints in Wall-Mounted Smart Displays</h2>\n<p>\n  Enclosing high-performance silicon inside a sealed in-wall enclosure introduces extreme thermal bottlenecks. Without convective airflow, heat dissipation relies strictly on conductive thermal mass spreaders and perimeter passive radiation.\n</p>\n<p>\n  By utilizing structural die-cast aluminum chassis plates bonded with high-performance phase-change thermal interface materials (TIM), surface temperatures remain safely below touch thresholds while preventing processor thermal throttling under continuous 1080p camera decoding.\n</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"schematic-card\" id=\"fig02-inwall-thermal-cad\">\n  <div class=\"schematic-header\">\n    <span class=\"schematic-title\">FIG 02 — IN-WALL CHASSIS THERMAL DISSIPATION STACK</span>\n    <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; color:var(--muted);\">PASSIVE CONDUCTION • ENCLOSURE T_MAX &lt; 43°C • ZERO AIRFLOW</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"schematic-viewport\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 960 420\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; display:block;\">\n      <rect width=\"960\" height=\"420\" rx=\"8\" class=\"svg-canvas-bg\" />\n\n      <!-- TOP TIER BADGES -->\n      <g>\n        <rect x=\"80\" y=\"25\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" class=\"svg-panel-bg\" stroke=\"#3B82F6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        <text x=\"190\" y=\"43\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#3B82F6\" font-weight=\"700\">A-SURFACE: TOUCH GLASS (T &lt; 38°C)</text>\n        <line x1=\"190\" y1=\"53\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#3B82F6\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"120\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#3B82F6\"/>\n\n        <rect x=\"370\" y=\"25\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" class=\"svg-panel-bg\" stroke=\"#DC2626\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        <text x=\"480\" y=\"43\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#DC2626\" font-weight=\"700\">SILICON JUNCTION: T_J = 78°C (SoC)</text>\n        <line x1=\"480\" y1=\"53\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#DC2626\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"480\" cy=\"150\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#DC2626\"/>\n\n        <rect x=\"660\" y=\"25\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" class=\"svg-panel-bg\" stroke=\"#10B981\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        <text x=\"770\" y=\"43\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#10B981\" font-weight=\"700\">HEAT SINK: DRYWALL STUD CONDUCTION</text>\n        <line x1=\"770\" y1=\"53\" x2=\"770\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#10B981\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"770\" cy=\"120\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#10B981\"/>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- MECHANICAL CROSS SECTION (Y: 90 - 320) -->\n      <g transform=\"translate(60, 95)\">\n        <!-- Wall Cavity Boundary -->\n        <rect x=\"660\" y=\"10\" width=\"180\" height=\"210\" class=\"svg-panel-bg\" stroke=\"#78716C\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,4\"/>\n        <text x=\"750\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#78716C\" font-weight=\"700\">STUD CAVITY (AIR GAP)</text>\n\n        <!-- Front Glass Cover Plate (Layer 1) -->\n        <rect x=\"60\" y=\"10\" width=\"22\" height=\"210\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#0284C7\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <line x1=\"71\" y1=\"225\" x2=\"71\" y2=\"255\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <line x1=\"71\" y1=\"255\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"255\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"71\" cy=\"225\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#38BDF8\"/>\n        <text x=\"168\" y=\"259\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"8.5\" fill=\"#38BDF8\" font-weight=\"700\">ALUMINOSILICATE COVER GLASS (1.1mm)</text>\n\n        <!-- Display OLED / Touch Module (Layer 2) -->\n        <rect x=\"86\" y=\"20\" width=\"16\" height=\"190\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#1E293B\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n\n        <!-- Main Logic Board PCB (Layer 3) -->\n        <rect x=\"130\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"170\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#059669\" stroke=\"#10B981\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n\n        <!-- High-Performance SoC (Processor) -->\n        <rect x=\"146\" y=\"95\" width=\"20\" height=\"40\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#DC2626\" stroke=\"#EF4444\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n\n        <!-- Phase-Change Material (TIM) -->\n        <rect x=\"166\" y=\"95\" width=\"10\" height=\"40\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#F59E0B\" stroke=\"#D97706\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n\n        <!-- Die-Cast Aluminum Midframe Heat Spreader (Layer 4) -->\n        <path d=\"M 176 15 L 230 15 L 230 75 L 340 75 L 340 155 L 230 155 L 230 215 L 176 215 Z\" fill=\"#44403C\" stroke=\"#78716C\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n\n        <!-- Heat Pipe / Vapor Transfer Path -->\n        <line x1=\"176\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#EA580C\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <line x1=\"480\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"660\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#D97706\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <polygon points=\"320,111 335,115 320,119\" fill=\"#FFF\"/>\n        <polygon points=\"520,111 535,115 520,119\" fill=\"#FFF\"/>\n\n        <!-- Rear Passive Stamped Heat Sink Fins (Layer 5) -->\n        <rect x=\"480\" y=\"30\" width=\"180\" height=\"170\" rx=\"4\" class=\"svg-panel-bg\" stroke=\"#D97706\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <g stroke=\"#D97706\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n          <line x1=\"520\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"185\"/>\n          <line x1=\"560\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"560\" y2=\"185\"/>\n          <line x1=\"600\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"185\"/>\n          <line x1=\"640\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"185\"/>\n        </g>\n\n        <!-- TIM Callout Leader -->\n        <line x1=\"171\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"171\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#F59E0B\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <line x1=\"171\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#F59E0B\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"171\" cy=\"95\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#F59E0B\"/>\n        <text x=\"258\" y=\"64\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"8.5\" fill=\"#F59E0B\" font-weight=\"700\">PHASE-CHANGE TIM (k = 6.5 W/m·K)</text>\n\n        <!-- Passive Fin Callout Leader -->\n        <line x1=\"600\" y1=\"185\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"255\" stroke=\"#D97706\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <line x1=\"600\" y1=\"255\" x2=\"510\" y2=\"255\" stroke=\"#D97706\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"600\" cy=\"185\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#D97706\"/>\n        <text x=\"500\" y=\"259\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"8.5\" fill=\"#D97706\" font-weight=\"700\">ANODIZED DISSIPATION FINS (R_th &lt; 1.8 K/W)</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- BOTTOM KINEMATICS BANNER -->\n      <g transform=\"translate(45, 345)\">\n        <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"870\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" class=\"svg-panel-bg\" stroke=\"var(--border)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        <text x=\"18\" y=\"20\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#3B82F6\">SEALED ENCLOSURE CONDUCTION METRICS:</text>\n        <text x=\"18\" y=\"36\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"8.5\" class=\"svg-text-primary\">Steady-State Thermal Power: P = 14.5W • Conductive Spread: A_eff = 340 cm² • External Delta: ΔT &lt; 18°C above ambient</text>\n      </g>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"schematic-caption\">\n    <span><strong>IN-WALL CONDUCTION ARCHITECTURE:</strong> Layered CAD cross-section illustrating passive heat flow from SoC silicon through phase-change TIM into the perimeter structural spreader.</span>\n    <span>FIGURE 02</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"telemetry-bar\">\n  <div class=\"telemetry-info\">\n    <span class=\"telemetry-title\">Background Quality Telemetry</span>\n    <span class=\"telemetry-desc\">Rate this topic to train the automated curation model for future dispatches.</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"telemetry-actions\">\n    <button class=\"score-btn\" id=\"telemetry-up\" onclick=\"recordTelemetry('up')\">\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M14 9V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3l-4 9v11h11.28a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.7l1.38-9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2.3zM7 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3\"></path></svg>\n      Good Topic\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"score-btn\" id=\"telemetry-down\" onclick=\"recordTelemetry('down')\">\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M10 15v4a3 3 0 0 0 3 3l4-9V2H5.72a2 2 0 0 0-2 1.7l-1.38 9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2.3zm7-13h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-3\"></path></svg>\n      Poor Topic\n    </button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
}